        {
            "title": "城堡投資已解除Aschenbrenner基金逾八成風險敞口",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"城堡投資已解除Aschenbrenner基金逾八成風險敞口\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/03b12eb72923178b43fc9f2bbf5726ab509d08606584f5b99e9fc93014fbdf9f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEA8400B_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">城堡投資已解除Aschenbrenner基金逾八成風險敞口</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - 據CNBC週五引述城堡投資（Citadel）創辦人肯·格里芬（Ken Griffin）致客戶的內部信函報導，城堡投資已解除從Leopold Aschenbrenner旗下對沖基金<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/Situational Awareness\" rel=\"\">Situational Awareness</a>所收購投資組合中逾80%的風險敞口。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">格里芬表示，城堡投資完成了逾100筆大手交易，市值超過40億美元，以降低從這隻專注人工智能領域基金所購入原有持倉的風險。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-6ddf833d-e156-3b93-8a1c-a5179e1f1772-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">據CNBC所取得的這封信函顯示，城堡投資於2026年7月29日開始與Situational Awareness洽談，商議收購該基金部分持倉。CNBC記者大衛·費伯（David Faber）於翌日報導，Situational Awareness因遭受重大虧損，被迫出售其所有公開市場股票持倉，城堡投資其後被確認為買家。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">格里芬在信中指出，完成如此規模的交易，有賴於服務雙方的各大銀行交易及主要經紀業務團隊的全力配合，並對各方在投資組合快速轉讓過程中所付出的高效努力表示感謝。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">這位城堡投資創辦人亦確認，旗艦多策略基金Wellington於7月份錄得5.94%的回報，創下該基金自2022年以來最佳單月表現。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Situational Awareness由前OpenAI研究員Leopold Aschenbrenner創立，因重倉且高槓桿押注人工智能相關股票出現逆轉，7月份損失約67%。該基金據報在2026年上半年曾累計上漲439%，但其後包括SanDisk及美光科技（Micron）在內的持倉股價急挫，迫使基金迅速平倉。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在Situational Awareness尋求流動性並降低槓桿之際，城堡投資接手了數十億美元的資產。該基金保留了部分私人投資，例如在Anthropic的股權，並未完全清盤。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%9F%8E%E5%A0%A1%E6%8A%95%E8%B3%87%E5%B7%B2%E8%A7%A3%E9%99%A4aschenbrenner%E5%9F%BA%E9%87%91%E9%80%BE%E5%85%AB%E6%88%90%E9%A2%A8%E9%9A%AA%E6%95%9E%E5%8F%A3-155933266.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-08-22 00:10:25",
